WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:19.171
Hi there! Who are you?

2
00:00:19.172 --> 00:00:23.039
I'm a flying fox.

3
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:27.856
We're the biggest kind of bat.

4
00:00:27.857 --> 00:00:30.777
Where do you live?

5
00:00:30.778 --> 00:00:36.467
Most flying foxes live in Asia and Australia.

6
00:00:36.468 --> 00:00:40.168
We move around a lot.

7
00:00:40.169 --> 00:00:45.447
But we like rain forests and swamps.

8
00:00:45.448 --> 00:00:48.761
Do you live alone?

9
00:00:48.762 --> 00:00:51.343
Nope!

10
00:00:51.344 --> 00:00:56.029
Flying foxes live in huge groups.

11
00:00:56.030 --> 00:01:01.854
Some groups have a million flying foxes!

12
00:01:01.855 --> 00:01:05.382
You have big wings!

13
00:01:05.383 --> 00:01:09.640
Yes, our wings are very strong.

14
00:01:09.641 --> 00:01:13.576
We can carry our babies while flying.

15
00:01:13.577 --> 00:01:16.713
Bats sleep in caves, right?

16
00:01:16.714 --> 00:01:19.607
Some bats do.

17
00:01:19.608 --> 00:01:23.392
But we sleep in trees.

18
00:01:23.393 --> 00:01:28.085
We hang upside down from branches.

19
00:01:28.086 --> 00:01:30.686
What do you eat?

20
00:01:30.687 --> 00:01:35.605
Flying foxes mostly eat nectar from flowers.

21
00:01:35.606 --> 00:01:40.845
We also love fruit.

22
00:01:40.846 --> 00:01:44.365
Is it hard to find food?

23
00:01:44.366 --> 00:01:47.890
Not for flying foxes!

24
00:01:47.891 --> 00:01:51.903
We can see really well.

25
00:01:51.904 --> 00:01:58.847
We can also smell things from far away.

26
00:01:58.848 --> 00:02:01.314
The sun is setting.

27
00:02:01.315 --> 00:02:04.943
Time for me to fly!

28
00:02:04.944 --> 00:02:11.697
Good-bye, Flying Fox!
